OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,C'We have no interest in hearing from   
OL,5,CHuw Edwards', Downing Street says      
OL,6,GThe prime minister's spokesperson has  
OL,7,Gsaid broadcasters must "act            
OL,8,Gresponsibly" and that "we have no      
OL,9,Ginterest in hearing" what Huw Edwards  
OL,10,Ghas to say, following a backlash       
OL,11,Gagainst new interviews with the        
OL,12,Gdisgraced former BBC News presenter.   
OL,14,FEdwards, who was convicted in 2024 for 
OL,15,Fmaking indecent images of children,    
OL,16,Fhas been interviewed for a Channel 4   
OL,17,Fdocumentary plus a podcast by the      
OL,18,FObserver and Tortoise Media.           
